--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Prior work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The first reconstruction in this project (Residential Tower AM271) was produced
with the help of the img2threejs process harness:

    img2threejs
    https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

What was actually carried over from it is set out honestly in README.md under
"Provenance". In summary: one utility function was genuinely reused
(`build_detail_inventory.load_image`, a standard-library PNG decoder); its
spec/gating and PBR-extraction steps were used for one development subject only;
and its honesty discipline shaped the documentation conventions throughout. The
viewer, the geometry library, the measurement harness, the scoring loop and all
three 3D models in this repository are original work.

